OL,3,GNEWSANew grant scheme supports
OL,4,Acharities faster
OL,5,
OL,6,FCharities would be able to access
OL,7,Ffunding within five days as part of a
OL,8,Fnew grant scheme.
OL,10,FThe Guernsey Community Foundation said
OL,11,Fthe new express grants scheme launched
OL,12,Fon Tuesday would award grants of
OL,13,Fbetween #500 and #5,000 to charities
OL,14,Fthat need the money quickly.
OL,16,FThe money could be used to buy
OL,17,Fimportant equipment or supplies, or to
OL,18,Fmeet other one-off expenses unrelated
OL,19,Fto salaries.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
