OL,3,GNEWSANew grant scheme supports
OL,4,Acharities faster
OL,5,
OL,6,FJim Roberts, the foundation's chief
OL,7,Fexecutive, said: "We also know that
OL,8,Fcharities sometimes need help quickly,
OL,9,Fespecially when faced with an
OL,10,Funexpected cost."
